[{"id":"playwright-xdist-session","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest-xdist","并行"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>启用 pytest-xdist 后，Session 级 Fixture 通常执行多少次？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>xdist worker 是独立进程，各自拥有 Session 生命周期，因此共享外部资源仍需唯一命名、锁或专用隔离。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>整台机器只执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每个 worker 各执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每条测试执行一次\u003c/p>\n"}]}]